  "summary_text": "Beacon onboarding\nBeacon onboarding goes from five steps to three\nOriginal proposal and notes from last time and tradeoffs\nConcern with original proposal: that we're overthinking it\nNotes from last time is the scary part\nOpen question: what the plan is for tradeoffs\nTradeoffs is kind of fragile honestly\nPreference to look at it with fresh eyes rather than keep it behind a flag\nScope and edge cases and spreadsheet\nNotes on scope added to the doc\nEdge cases is not urgent\nEdge cases is a bit messy\nSpreadsheet is the easy part\nNo clear owner for spreadsheet\nPreference to loop in the other team rather than simplify it\nCopy on that screen and empty state and open questions\nCopy on that screen is unclear\nEmpty state is not a big deal\nConcern with empty state: that we bike-shed it\nNo clear owner for open questions\nPreference to map out the edge cases rather than do it properly\nFilter bar and process and metrics\nNotes on filter bar added to the doc\nFeedback on process from people on the other team: they seemed into it\nMetrics is not where i'd want it\nPreference to keep it behind a flag rather than loop in the other team\nNext steps\nSam to build the clickable Beacon prototype by Wednesday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Beacon onboarding\n- Beacon onboarding goes from five steps to three\n\n### Original proposal and notes from last time and tradeoffs\n- Concern with original proposal: that we're overthinking it\n- Notes from last time is the scary part\n- Open question: what the plan is for tradeoffs\n  - Tradeoffs is kind of fragile honestly\n- Preference to look at it with fresh eyes rather than keep it behind a flag\n\n### Scope and edge cases and spreadsheet\n- Notes on scope added to the doc\n- Edge cases is not urgent\n  - Edge cases is a bit messy\n- Spreadsheet is the easy part\n  - No clear owner for spreadsheet\n- Preference to loop in the other team rather than simplify it\n\n### Copy on that screen and empty state and open questions\n- Copy on that screen is unclear\n- Empty state is not a big deal\n  - Concern with empty state: that we bike-shed it\n- No clear owner for open questions\n- Preference to map out the edge cases rather than do it properly\n\n### Filter bar and process and metrics\n- Notes on filter bar added to the doc\n- Feedback on process from people on the other team: they seemed into it\n- Metrics is not where i'd want it\n- Preference to keep it behind a flag rather than loop in the other team\n\n### Next steps\n- Sam to build the clickable Beacon prototype by **Wednesday**",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
