        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "And for Beacon, I think the accessibility audit is the part that's pretty close.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:18.257000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:22.923000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Sorry, does I mean, the risks actually matter for Beacon?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:23.746000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:27.080000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Okay yeah, on the onboarding redesign, half of it is outdated, honestly.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:35.399000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:39.399000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "But it's funny, the edge cases looked under control before this call and now nothing jumped out",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:39.412000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:45.079000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Can we look at it with fresh eyes?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:45.143000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:47.810000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "I don't know if the motion specs is really the issue, in my opinion.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:47.902000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:52.569000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Oh no.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:07:59.716000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:00.383000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Actually, it's funny, the ownership question looked weirdly controversial last week and now we're doing it two different ways.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:02.973000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:09.306000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I saw that.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:07.840000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:08.440000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "It's less about the usability sessions and more about the timeline,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:10.714000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:14.381000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:12.693000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:13.293000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "I think.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:14.448000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:15.115000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:15.647000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:16.980000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I wouldn't block on the handoff to eng",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:17.994000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:20.661000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:21.959000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:23.292000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "So is the Slack thread still good enough for now, or did that change?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:23.634000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:28.301000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, I don't know if the color tokens is really the issue, more or less. Okay, so the copy on that screen is unclear, but the mobile layout is a nice to have. And honestly the dark mode pass only needs dozen tickets if we loop in the other team. And then I think the empty state is not a a big deal and the handoff is ahead of where I expected, so maybe test it with a few users",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:28.933000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:55.600000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "The onboarding redesign is kind of the test case for the scope",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:55.674000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:59.674000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:08:59.697000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:01.030000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "I guess we said we'd just ship the smaller version and then the error messages happened. So nobody really owns the open questions right now. Plus the annoying thing about the motion specs is it's way more complicated than it looks. Anyway, someone on sales mentioned the like modal pattern over the weekend, so it's on people's radar. Which, I'd rather loop in the other team than simplify it, in my opinion. I'd love to get more data, but the avatar treatment is the obvious next thing. Which, I don't know know if the doc is really issue, kind of.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:01.117000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:34.450000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "The annoying thing about the design critique is it's unclear.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:45.936000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:49.270000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Yeah,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:49.343000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:49.943000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "I'd love to cut the scope, but the table density is still a mess",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:49.998000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:54.665000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "And I'm not convinced the type scale is hard to reason about, at least for now...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:09:54.741000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:00.074000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Sure.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:02.394000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:02.994000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "The big change is three steps instead of five, we merge workspace setup and invites.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:04.335000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:09.335000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, and nobody really owns the spreadsheet right now.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:09.343000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:12.343000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, so it's like, the next steps is good enough for now and nobody wants to say it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:12.915000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:18.915000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, the thing I'd push on is the follow ups, I like don't know.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:18.930000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:23.597000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Which,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:25.150000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:25.750000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "is the accessibility audit still mostly fine, or did change?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:25.783000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:29.117000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:28.620000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:29.220000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, I think the risk is that it's hard to roll back",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:29.210000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:33.210000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "so yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:33.351000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:34.018000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Wait",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:34.093000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:34.693000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "can we draw it on a whiteboard?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:34.780000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:37.113000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Right, so if the type scale slips again, Beacon is going to feel it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:37.129000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:41.795000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Are we worried about the tooltip pattern? Nobody really owns the pricing page right right now, anyway. Also, the short version is the modal pattern is not a big deal, anyway. Okay yeah, it's like, the avatar treatment is ahead of where I expected and nobody wants to say it. Yeah, on Beacon, the feedback was mixed...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:10:42.308000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:01.308000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, totally.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:06.440000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:07.107000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Right, so for the onboarding redesign, I think the feedback is the part that's a known issue.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:08.151000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:13.817000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "So yeah, my worry with the communication plan is that we're solving the wrong problem.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:13.883000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:18.883000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Plus if we write it down",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:19.214000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:21.214000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "then the requirements gets a lot easier.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:21.534000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:23.868000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, for the onboarding redesign, I think the edge cases is the part that's mostly cosmetic.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:23.934000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:29.267000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:28.195000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:28.795000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I think the risk is that we're solving the wrong problem.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:37.395000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:41.061000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, that's basically what we saw with the avatar treatment on Beacon.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:41.859000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:45.859000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Okay yeah, I'm not super excited about the design critique,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:45.934000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:49.267000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "to be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:49.299000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:50.299000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "I was was looking at the Slack thread a while back and people seem confused by it, honestly. And for the onboarding redesign specifically, the tradeoffs is kind of fragile honestly, in my opinion.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:11:52.050000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:03.384000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "But can we pair on it?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:12.035000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:14.035000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, agreed.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:14.232000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:14.899000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "On the onboarding redesign, it's not as like bad as like it sounded, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:15.361000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:20.028000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Mm.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:17.785000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:18.385000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Right",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:20.743000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:21.343000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "and I spent 10 minutes on the edge cases and it looked pretty reasonable.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:21.422000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:26.088000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Right, and we keep going back and forth on the ownership question, anyway. And nobody really owns the usability sessions right now, I don't know. Yeah, so when I looked at the tooltip pattern for the onboarding redesign, I couldn't reproduce it. Yeah, so I wouldn't block block on the loading states. Plus I put some notes on the filter bar in the doc, at least for now.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:26.164000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:48.831000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Got it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:40.974000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:41.574000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Love it. Sam, like can you get a clickable prototype for like usability testing?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:48.891000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:53.558000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Mm.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:51.404000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:52.004000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Yes, clickable prototype by next Wednesday.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:53.610000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:55.610000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Well, I talked too people on the other team about the process and they seemed into it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:12:57.051000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:02.717000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, and how did the next steps go?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:02.762000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:05.429000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Honestly, it's funny,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:05.962000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:06.962000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "the form validation looked under control yesterday and now nothing jumped out.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:07Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:11Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh, nice.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:09.693000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:10.293000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "For what it's worth, the annoying thing about the icon set is it's pretty close.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:11.010000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:16.010000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So yeah, the metrics is not where I'd want it, but the feedback is basically done.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:16.075000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:21.408000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I'd rather map out the edge cases than do it properly",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:21.500000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:25.500000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "but yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:25.598000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:26.264000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And on the onboarding redesign, I had more questions than answers",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:26.293000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:29.960000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:28.878000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:29.478000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "too be honest.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:30.039000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:31.039000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:31.062000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:31.662000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Real quick",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:31.734000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:32.401000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I talked to a couple of folks on support about the button hierarchy and they pushed back a like bit.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:32.414000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:39.081000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:39.157000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:39.757000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "the data folks keep asking about the spacing,",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:40.699000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:43.366000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "if that makes sense.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:43.463000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:44.796000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Basically we keep going back and forth on the scope, I don't know.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:45.103000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:49.436000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Oh no.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:51.935000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:52.602000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I talked to the",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:53.041000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:54.374000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "design team about the onboarding flow and they didn't love it...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:54.440000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:13:58.107000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I wouldn't block on the handoff, if that makes sense.",
