      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:27.142000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "Also, it's like, the edge cases is a bit messy and nobody wants to say it...",
