      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:32.503000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Megan Liu"
      },
      "text": "From the front end side three steps is easier anyway...",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:33.688000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:37.021000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I think my worry with the empty state is that we bike-shed it.",
