      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:41.717000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Real quick, if the accessibility audit slips again, Beacon is going to feel it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:41.757000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:46.423000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Sam Okafor"
      },
      "text": "Okay, cool.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:46.445000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:47.111000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Oh",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:47.159000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:47.759000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "I talked to the data folks about the dependencies like and they were kind of lukewarm.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:47.790000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:53.123000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:55.392000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:55.992000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:56.070000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:56.670000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I think that's basically what we saw with the settings page on Beacon.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:14:56.707000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:01.040000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "So I put some notes on the backlog in the doc, anyway.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:01.277000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:05.277000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:05.869000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:06.469000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay, I feel like the Slack thread is a little fragile, but yeah.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:08.978000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:13.312000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:13.359000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:13.959000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I spent a week or two on the dependencies and the docs don't match reality.",
