      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:26.137000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:24.505000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:25.105000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I talked to people on the other team about the doc and they didn't love it. Um, is the mobile layout still a bit of a black box, or did that change?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:27.694000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:38.361000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Honestly the requirements only needs most of the afternoon if we cut the scope.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:39.921000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:44.588000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "And",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:44.681000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:45.281000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Beacon is kind of the test case for the icon set.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:45.283000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:48.950000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah. I'm cautiously optimistic about the requirements, kind of.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:48.968000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:51.968000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Okay",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:52.015000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:52.615000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "we said we'd map out the edge cases and then the empty empty state happened.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:52.657000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:57.657000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Got it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:55.207000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-09T15:15:55.807000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Lena Fischer"
      },
      "text": "Um, can we map out the edge cases?",
